#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:39
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_WroteSecretCodeLockOpened"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} wrote down the secret code\n"
"on the door.\p"
"“TRICK MASTER is fabulous.”\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"The lock clicked open!$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}在门上写下了暗号。\p"
"“机关大王真了不起。”\n"
"…… …… …… …… …… …… …… ……\p"
"咔嚓一声，锁打开了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_SallyIntro"
msgid ""
"I'll hack and slash my way to victory\n"
"with the CUT we just learned!$"
msgstr ""
"我要用刚学会的居合斩，\n"
"一路砍出一条胜利之路！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:50
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_SallyDefeat"
msgid "Why are you so serious?$"
msgstr "你干吗这么认真啊？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:53
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_SallyPostBattle"
msgid ""
"I never get tired of hacking\n"
"and slashing!$"
msgstr "砍来砍去，我永远都不会腻！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:57
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_EddieIntro"
msgid ""
"I wandered into this weird house\n"
"by accident…$"
msgstr "我不小心闯进了这间奇怪的房子……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_EddieDefeat"
msgid "And now I've lost…$"
msgstr "结果现在还输了……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:64
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_EddiePostBattle"
msgid ""
"I lost my way, I lost a battle, and I'm\n"
"now even more lost… I can't get out…$"
msgstr ""
"我迷了路，又输了对战，\n"
"现在更迷茫了……我出不去了……$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:68
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_RobinIntro"
msgid "Just who is the TRICK MASTER?$"
msgstr "机关大王到底是什么人？$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:71
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_RobinDefeat"
msgid "I lost while I was lost in thought!$"
msgstr "我想得太入神，结果就输了！$"

#: data/maps/Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1/scripts.inc:74
msgctxt "Route110_TrickHousePuzzle1_Text_RobinPostBattle"
msgid ""
"You're strong!\n"
"Just who are you?$"
msgstr "你好强！你到底是什么人？$"
